<h2 id="chapter-attindex" data-bs-page="attindex">Appendix G: Attribute Index</h2>


<p class="normativity"><em>This appendix is informative, not normative.</em></p>

<h3 id="RegularAttributes" oldids="attindex-RegularAttributes">Regular attributes</h3>

<p>The following table lists all of the attributes defined in the SVG
language, except for the [=presentation attributes=], which are treated
in the <a href="#attindex-PresentationAttributes">Presentation attributes</a>
section below.  For each attribute, the elements on which the attribute
may be specified is also given.</p>

<div data-svg-fill="attribute-table"></div>

<h3 id="attindex-PresentationAttributes" data-multipage-id="PresentationAttributes">Presentation attributes</h3>

<p>As described in the <a href="#chapter-styling">Styling</a> chapter, for each
[=properties|property=] there exists a corresponding [=presentation attributes|presentation attribute=].
The table below lists the presentation attributes.</p>
   
<span data-svg-fill="attribute-category" data-name="presentation" data-omit-quotes=""></span>
